xt":"・備考："},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公。見た目的には、落ち着いているように見えるが、実はおっとり＆のんびりしているだけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"良介に告白された日の夜、つい、ちょっとだけ自慰してしまった所を写真に撮られて、それをネタに脅され始める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最初は、ただ「神村　良介と別れろ」という内容の脅迫文だけだったのが、ある日突然、見知らぬ男達が現れた事で、悪夢のような境遇におかれてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27138"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/67d3af01cc5e316d9481cf77819ae4594cf21d70a07f4c022d4599da02a39777.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2ac7a6b48bd7c385cb318111c13f831f2f04f807ac5a2e67426795a46fbdccae.webp","width":240,"height":240,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"川崎恵理子","creatorId":"vndb:s121","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s121","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s121","name":"川崎 恵理子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:85398:27138:4034:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c32743","characterName":"秋山 未来","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"27822","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"114894"},{"characterId":"27822","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"350885"}],"egsCharacterIds":["20930"],"vndbCharacterId":"c32743"},"originalCharacterName":"秋山 未来","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【貧乳元気娘】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"咲、繭、あやめ、未来の４人は、仲良し４人組。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は明るく賑やかで、仲間内ではムードメーカー的な役割を担う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"咲と同じ陸上部に所属している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なんでもそつなくこなす咲に憧れを抱いており、なにかと彼女につきまとう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"20930","sourceWorkId":"5010","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明日香の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":